@startuml pid_cascata

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam RectangleBorderThickness 1.2
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #555555
skinparam RectangleFontColor #222222

left to right direction

rectangle "Referência\n(x_d, y_d, z_d)" as REF #EEEEEE

rectangle "PID Posição\n~50–100 Hz" as POS #D5CCF7
rectangle "PID Atitude\n~250–500 Hz" as ATT #C0EAE0
rectangle "PID Taxa\n~500–1000 Hz" as RATE #BEDAF5
rectangle "Motor Mixing" as MIX #DDDDDD
rectangle "Motores e Planta" as PLANT #FAEEDA

REF  -right-> POS
POS  -right-> ATT  : φ_d, θ_d, T
ATT  -right-> RATE : p_d, q_d, r_d
RATE -right-> MIX  : τ_φ, τ_θ, τ_ψ
MIX  -right-> PLANT

PLANT -up-> RATE  : taxas (p,q,r)\ngiroscópio
PLANT -up-> ATT   : ângulos (φ,θ,ψ)\nIMU
PLANT -up-> POS   : posição (x,y,z)\nfluxo óptico / GPS

note bottom of POS : Malha externa\n(mais lenta)
note bottom of RATE : Malha interna\n(mais rápida)

@enduml
